      "content": "interesting. but youre saying we have to emphasize the systemic stuff to teach critical thinking. some parents at the meeting are saying that if we focus too much on the \"power struggles\" and injustices, we're just making kids feel guilty or resentful about their own country instead of proud of it. isn't teaching national pride and shared values also a valid way to build social cohesion?",
